This map demostrates a transformation from a norbiton industrial area now to a future planned development.

The changes between 2 maps are quite a lot. For example, The houses in the south-east sides are combined and a new playground is developed on the north-east side. A new branch is added on the west side of the map, which developed a shops and a few houses. A bridge is added on the river, creating a big housing. A ring is added on the south side of the road. School was developed on the east side of the map, about 1 block away from the playground. A medical centre ia created on the south side of the map, right beside the ring on the south side. The things that haven't changed is the main road and the river. This also includes the farmland on the north side, next to the river.

Overall, lots of facilities were created, including shops, school etc.. branched and bridges were created and houses were combined and created.